# 4. Project Planning Phase

**Project Name:** FitBuddy – AI Fitness Plan Generator using Gemini Models

## Development Plan

1. Select Gemini AI models and design the architecture.
2. Set up the Python development environment.
3. Develop workout and nutrition features.
4. Implement FastAPI routes and database.
5. Design the frontend using HTML, CSS and Jinja2.
6. Test the application locally.
7. Prepare the project for demonstration.

## Tools & Technologies

* Python
* FastAPI
* Google Gemini AI
* SQLite
* SQLAlchemy
* HTML/CSS/Jinja2
* Git

## Expected Deliverable

A working AI-powered fitness application that generates personalized 7-day workout plans and nutrition tips.
